Z||000002||Master_Sushi||12-05-2001||01:41 AM||||Eggs are fun. When I was a little kid there was an old microwave in the garage. I use to put some strange stuff into it.<P>I once had an egg in it for a min or so. It didnt blow up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">. So stupid me, I take it out and look closely at it. Then it decided to blow up in my face  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">. Hot egg all over ones face dosen't feel to well. Be carefull.<P>I've also heard some strange things can happen if you boil water in a microwave. I haven't seens anything though.||||reg||10
